en do not go for check-ups during pregnancy", "category": [0.105993, 0.029675, 0.355629, 0.030557, 0.392231, 0.013078, 0.026913, 0.045925], "severity": [0.003208, 0.051767, 0.741883, 0.200697, 0.002445], "dm_phase": [0.910454, 0.024143, 0.062465, 0.002938]}, {"text": "sickle cell wale bachcho ko khoon chadhane Ranchi jana padta hai, har mahine", "category": [0.218528, 0.206884, 0.041882, 0.20096, 0.079599, 0.013114, 0.203478, 0.035555], "severity": [0.008431, 0.241484, 0.552008, 0.178698, 0.019379], "dm_phase": [0.440221, 0.129433, 0.230471, 0.199874]}, {"text": "gaon ke 5 buzurg aankh se dekh nahi pate, motiyabind ka camp kabhi nahi laga", "category": [0.207511, 0.160485, 0.139862, 0.09428, 0.186092, 0.028697, 0.133859, 0.049214], "severity": [0.013203, 0.153709, 0.682718, 0.149126, 0.001244], "dm_phase": [0.45168, 0.12154, 0.343043, 0.083737]}, {"text": "hadiya pee ke jhagda aur ladke nashe me, koi nasha mukti kendra nahi", "category": [0.257345, 0.057461, 0.370251, 0.031722, 0.137584, 0.10449, 0.018086, 0.02306], "severity": [0.001649, 0.018737, 0.434939, 0.537347, 0.007328], "dm_phase": [0.716189, 0.032975, 0.241981, 0.008855]}, {"text": "कक्षा 5 के बच्चे अपना नाम भी नहीं पढ़ पाते", "category": [0.031895, 0.028098, 0.078827, 0.795928, 0.015296, 0.008255, 0.02243, 0.01927], "severity": [0.024327, 0.491401, 0.469759, 0.014455, 5.8e-05], "dm_phase": [0.98064, 0.005646, 0.01174, 0.001975]}, {"text": "school me Santali bolne wale bachche Hindi nahi samajhte, teacher sirf Hindi me padhate", "category": [0.007257, 0.000581, 0.000501, 0.987332, 0.002615, 0.000453, 0.000619, 0.000643], "severity": [0.028036, 0.670027, 0.300326, 0.001599, 1.1e-05], "dm_phase": [0.990885, 0.005827, 0.000874, 0.002414]}, {"text": "the hostel for tribal girls has no warden and no lock on the door", "category": [0.190064, 0.186463, 0.038111, 0.403684, 0.043207, 0.103376, 0.012246, 0.02285], "severity": [0.000714, 0.016172, 0.157506, 0.796655, 0.028953], "dm_phase": [0.188034, 0.014776, 0.792902, 0.004288]}, {"text": "barsat me school ki chhat se paani aur current dono aate hai", "category": [0.042686, 0.355203, 0.002908, 0.468736, 0.011013, 0.042711, 0.053821, 0.022922], "severity": [0.002759, 0.367281, 0.536199, 0.093146, 0.000615], "dm_phase": [0.988283, 0.001314, 0.008398, 0.002004]}, {"text": "10vi ke baad college 40 km door, ladkiyan aage nahi padh pati", "category": [0.091608, 0.004935, 0.009798, 0.8667, 0.008785, 0.007712, 0.00364, 0.006822], "severity": [0.004823, 0.30773, 0.674859, 0.012408, 0.00018], "dm_phase": [0.795925, 0.018821, 0.135445, 0.049809]}, {"text": "machli palan ke talab me machhliyan mar ke upar aa gayi", "category": [0.630106, 0.141506, 0.147986, 0.008454, 0.010679, 0.029425, 0.025236, 0.006609], "severity": [5.5e-05, 0.007577, 0.461073, 0.341598, 0.189698], "dm_phase": [0.806516, 0.001591, 0.190541, 0.001352]}, {"text": "लाह की खेती का बीज नहीं मिला, पेड़ खाली रह गए", "category": [0.019022, 0.003436, 0.013632, 0.015357, 0.898863, 0.00782, 0.010167, 0.031703], "severity": [0.028225, 0.618547, 0.347132, 0.006031, 6.4e-05], "dm_phase": [0.971388, 0.003579, 0.022749, 0.002284]}, {"text": "cold storage nahi hai to aalu 2 rupaye kilo bechna pada", "category": [0.271252, 0.033162, 0.019979, 0.149806, 0.324023, 0.041222, 0.127884, 0.032673], "severity": [0.00166, 0.319738, 0.549627, 0.126852, 0.002122], "dm_phase": [0.701212, 0.096721, 0.130079, 0.071989]}, {"text": "wild boars and elephants destroy our maize every night, we have no fencing", "category": [0.857999, 0.00534, 0.0537, 0.003415, 0.015191, 0.003744, 0.04942, 0.01119], "severity": [0.000439, 0.012256, 0.128277, 0.783756, 0.075272], "dm_phase": [0.033614, 0.006595, 0.954668, 0.005122]}, {"text": "PM kisan ka paisa 3 kisht se nahi aaya aur bank bolta KYC karo", "category": [0.043814, 0.189003, 0.140003, 0.019837, 0.240841, 0.034445, 0.268951, 0.063105], "severity": [0.002614, 0.125304, 0.642652, 0.227926, 0.001503], "dm_phase": [0.586911, 0.009263, 0.384976, 0.01885]}, {"text": "dhaan me jhulsa rog laga, patte laal ho rahe, dawai ka pata nahi", "category": [0.047648, 0.011905, 0.43241, 0.006249, 0.255059, 0.018209, 0.012709, 0.215809], "severity": [0.000406, 0.032262, 0.837553, 0.129415, 0.000364], "dm_phase": [0.940551, 0.014202, 0.037509, 0.007738]}, {"text": "PMGSY ki sadak aadhi bani aur thekedar bhaag gaya", "category": [0.101263, 0.143843, 0.003476, 0.003925, 0.037424, 0.705189, 0.002674, 0.002207], "severity": [0.0001, 0.009645, 0.294577, 0.662829, 0.032849], "dm_phase": [0.03769, 0.000845, 0.95244, 0.009025]}, {"text": "पंचायत भवन में दरवाजे खिड़की चोरी, कोई बैठक नहीं हो सकती", "category": [0.226669, 0.018391, 0.047977, 0.190098, 0.213899, 0.262402, 0.016095, 0.024468], "severity": [0.006351, 0.39597, 0.485045, 0.110875, 0.001759], "dm_phase": [0.884827, 0.045691, 0.063079, 0.006403]}, {"text": "the wooden footbridge the children use is rotting and one plank broke last week", "category": [0.062383, 0.019269, 0.016882, 0.003588, 0.004821, 0.879587, 0.001024, 0.012447], "severity": [3.5e-05, 0.002311, 0.260757, 0.651299, 0.085597], "dm_phase": [0.688975, 0.003845, 0.301841, 0.005339]}, {"text": "ghat road pe railing nahi, bus khai me gir sakti hai", "category": [0.008662, 6.3e-05, 0.001343, 0.000634, 0.000853, 0.987177, 0.000927, 0.000342], "severity": [0.0002, 0.003522, 0.074672, 0.8509, 0.070706], "dm_phase": [0.146289, 0.004966, 0.848092, 0.000653]}, {"text": "barish me causeway ke upar se nadi behti hai, 5 gaon ka hospital jaana band", "category": [0.035173, 0.024267, 0.60227, 0.013588, 0.152962, 0.138586, 0.012585, 0.02057], "severity": [0.000377, 0.042888, 0.568853, 0.347838, 0.040044], "dm_phase": [0.696635, 0.006742, 0.145551, 0.151073]}, {"text": "meter laga do saal ho gaye, bill 9000 aaya jabki light 4 ghanta rehti", "category": [0.3379, 0.01819, 0.033699, 0.004595, 0.014699, 0.00386, 0.580281, 0.006776], "severity": [1.9e-05, 0.001701, 0.119939, 0.683936, 0.194406], "dm_phase": [0.018897, 0.027238, 0.952025, 0.00184]},